WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.983
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.531 --> 00:00:10.364
- Hey everyone, my name is Jesse.

00:00:10.364 --> 00:00:12.450
And today I'm gonna be testing four famous

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:13.780
celebrity mac and cheese recipes

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.790
to see which one is actually the best.

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.870
I'll be testing recipes
from Patti LaBelle,

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.580
Gordon Ramsay, Khloe Kardashian

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.320
and I even have one from Rihanna.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.050
I measure everything up,
how the recipe stated

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:24.620
and I got three of my friends to taste it

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.950
in a blind taste test.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:26.895
So which one's gon' be best?

00:00:26.895 --> 00:00:28.610
It's about to get cheesy.

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:29.882
First up, is Patti LaBelle.

00:00:29.882 --> 00:00:32.260
She cooks her pasta in salted water

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.230
with a bit of oil, drains it,
then returns it to the pot.

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:37.114
In a large bowl, combine
shredded muenster,

00:00:37.114 --> 00:00:40.430
both mild and sharp cheddars,
and monterey jack cheese.

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:41.743
Add some half-and-half to the pasta,

00:00:41.743 --> 00:00:43.543
along with a cube Velveeta cheese,

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:45.492
melted butter and mix it in.

00:00:45.492 --> 00:00:47.962
Add even more cheese, keep stirring it

00:00:47.962 --> 00:00:51.643
and season it with seasoned
salt, pepper and kosher salt.

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.700
Transfer into a prepared
baking casserole dish

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.160
and top with more cheese
and a few dots of butter.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.150
Bake until nice and bubbly.

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:01.510
And serve.

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:05.020
- We have some browning
over here which is exciting.

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:06.220
- We got a nice texture.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.535
- Hmm.

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:11.720
- There's some beautiful
pockets of cheese,

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:15.320
like, just creamy, it's
actually delicious.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:16.260
- Very cheesy.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:17.775
Reminds me of craft mac and cheese.

00:01:17.775 --> 00:01:19.070
But I do enjoy it.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:21.270
It has nothing on top,
don't have no pepper flakes,

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:23.570
like nothing is going on to make me say,

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:25.236
this is some real sexy mac and cheese.

00:01:25.236 --> 00:01:26.500
This is boring.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.104
- Up next is Khloe Kardashian.

00:01:28.104 --> 00:01:30.564
She starts by cooking
macaroni in salted water

00:01:30.564 --> 00:01:32.680
until al dente and drains it.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.140
Heat some butter until melted,

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.890
then whisk in some flour and
cook for about two minutes.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:38.844
Add some milk and whisk until thickened.

00:01:38.844 --> 00:01:40.775
And this is where it gets kinda weird.

00:01:40.775 --> 00:01:43.186
You're gonna chop up some american cheese.

00:01:43.186 --> 00:01:45.146
Add it straight to the sauce.

00:01:45.146 --> 00:01:47.100
Then add some shredded cheddar.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.124
Stir until melted.

00:01:48.124 --> 00:01:51.920
Add paprika and egg yolk
and whisk even more.

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:54.266
Add the pasta back in
and stir so it coats.

00:01:54.266 --> 00:01:57.210
Grab a mini muffin pan, brush with butter,

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.884
and sprinkle with some Parmesan cheese.

00:01:58.884 --> 00:02:01.356
Spoon the prepared mac and cheese into it.

00:02:01.356 --> 00:02:03.495
Top with even more Parmesan

00:02:03.495 --> 00:02:05.773
and you're gonna bake
these until sizzling.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.200
Pop 'em out and these
little guys are done.

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:11.000
- It looks like I can take
this down in one bite.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.110
- Mad and cupcake.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:12.943
I like this one.

00:02:12.943 --> 00:02:15.330
- Presentation-wise, okay, yeah it's cute.

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:18.623
But I feel bamboozled with
the amount I'm getting.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:20.750
This one's alright.

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:23.310
- You got a good macaroni to cheese ratio.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.246
- If I went to the grocery store,

00:02:24.246 --> 00:02:26.280
and I walk by one of the little machines

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:27.290
with the toys in it.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:31.120
And one of the toys was the
plastic mac and cheese toy

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:32.410
that I could get for 25 cents.

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:33.548
That's what I'm chewing up right now.

00:02:33.548 --> 00:02:35.418
- Next up, is Gordon Ramsay.

00:02:35.418 --> 00:02:38.420
He cooks cauliflower in
salted water until tender.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.313
He fishes it out, drops
them in a bowl of ice water

00:02:40.313 --> 00:02:42.860
to prevent it from cooking any further.

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:44.810
Then he adds macaroni straight to that pot

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.880
of cauliflower water and
cooks it until tender.

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:49.076
He drains and he mixes it
with the cooked cauliflower

00:02:49.076 --> 00:02:51.668
and a few knobs of butter
and lets that melt in.

00:02:51.668 --> 00:02:53.898
Put that aside, heat some butter in a pan

00:02:53.898 --> 00:02:56.676
and add flour and mustard
powder to make a roux.

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:59.450
Gradually add some milk so it thickens up

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.893
and keep whisking until
it gets nice and thick.

00:03:01.893 --> 00:03:03.781
Season with cayenne pepper and salt.

00:03:03.781 --> 00:03:06.620
In a bowl, mix three cheeses together,

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.613
cheddar, Lincolnshire and Cheshire.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:12.900
Add those back into the
sauce and stir until melted.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.394
Add the cooked macaroni and cauliflower.

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:18.394
Mix it up to coat and spread
that into a large baking dish.

00:03:18.394 --> 00:03:20.470
And smooth it out on top.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:21.890
Combine the extra cheese

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:23.750
with some fresh breadcrumbs and thyme

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.200
and sprinkle that right on top.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.493
Bake until nice and golden.

00:03:26.493 --> 00:03:27.950
And that's about it.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.852
- We got some like,
little crusties on here.

00:03:29.852 --> 00:03:31.773
- This got a little crunch to it.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:34.630
- The crunchy stuff is delicious.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:36.000
I think it could be cheesier.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:36.833
- Alright, that's good.

00:03:36.833 --> 00:03:38.634
It tastes like a fluffy cloud,

00:03:38.634 --> 00:03:41.100
and then we get the
little slice of heaven.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:42.950
- I do like the way that this tastes.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.360
I don't know what's on it.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:45.860
It's got that mac and cheese with a twist.

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:47.493
- It might be cauliflower.

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:49.380
Someone important made
this mac and cheese.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:53.170
- Eating this mac and cheese
is like eating a great steak.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.943
- This is like Miss
Congeniality mac and cheese.

00:03:54.943 --> 00:03:57.463
It help people out but
it did not necessarily

00:03:57.463 --> 00:04:01.063
give enough to win the crown
of the best mac and cheese.

00:04:01.063 --> 00:04:02.495
Up next is Rihanna.

00:04:02.495 --> 00:04:05.570
She cooks macaroni in boiling
water, then drains it.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:08.260
Place it back on the stove
and add grated white onion,

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.380
julienne bell pepper and
some sliced spring onions.

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:12.000
And mix that all in.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.150
Next, add a quarter cup of
both ketchup and mustard

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:17.520
as well as some spicy
scotch bonnet pepper sauce.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.540
Then mix that all in.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.874
Add a handful of shredded
colby-jack cheese at a time.

00:04:21.874 --> 00:04:23.386
Stirring until melted.

00:04:23.386 --> 00:04:25.363
And add some water if it gets too thick.

00:04:25.363 --> 00:04:27.405
Once it's the right consistency,

00:04:27.405 --> 00:04:30.594
garnish with some more
spring onions and that's it.

00:04:30.594 --> 00:04:32.780
- It looks cheesy as hell.

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:33.930
- This is real festive.

00:04:35.727 --> 00:04:36.650
- Some real strong in here.

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.550
- The whole pepper, the
action that's happening,

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:40.980
they are making it an exciting experience.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.080
- I taste the peppers.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.210
It's actually pretty hot.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:44.460
- Closing my throat up a little bit.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:47.138
- There was some love put into
making this mac and cheese

00:04:47.138 --> 00:04:48.690
stand out from the rest.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:49.957
- I definitely pass on this one.

00:04:49.957 --> 00:04:52.460
- Which celebrity has the
best mac and cheese recipe?

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:53.293
Let's find out.

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:55.130
- Out of all the celebrity mac and cheese,

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:57.400
I think my favorite would
have to be number three.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.637
Mainly because the addition
with the cauliflower

00:04:59.637 --> 00:05:02.360
made it just stand out from all the rest.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.440
Wasn't a really cheesy and I'm not kidding

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:06.650
when I say, I can compare
it to a great steak.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:08.218
Gordon Ramsay, always coming in.

00:05:08.218 --> 00:05:09.570
Right at the last minute.

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:10.949
- I like number one the best.

00:05:10.949 --> 00:05:12.977
It was like the right types of cheese.

00:05:12.977 --> 00:05:15.220
It was like, pockets
of like, gooey cheese.

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:17.740
Perfect comforting mac and cheese.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:18.573
Patti LaBelle?

00:05:18.573 --> 00:05:19.406
Hell yeah.

00:05:19.406 --> 00:05:21.490
- The one that I can say
stood out the most to me,

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:23.670
number four, it had some color in there,

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.450
a little spicy into it.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.307
It was a different take on it.

00:05:26.307 --> 00:05:27.312
That's Rihanna?

00:05:27.312 --> 00:05:28.350
Makes sense.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:29.690
- So I heard I'm the tie breaker

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:31.280
for the celebrity mac and cheese.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:32.130
Let's go.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:33.163
This one's colorful.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.003
I don't like this one.

00:05:36.003 --> 00:05:37.260
I don't really like peppers, I guess, so.

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:38.440
I feel like you shouldn't put too much

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.223
extra shit in mac and cheese.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.373
This one's good, there's different

00:05:43.373 --> 00:05:44.750
types of cheeses on this one.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.100
I don't like this one either.

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:49.988
This one is my favorite one.

00:05:49.988 --> 00:05:51.840
- There you have it, Gordon Ramsay

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.636
has the best mac and cheese.

00:05:53.636 --> 00:05:56.553
(triumphant music)

